<title>BULGARIA: FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR JULY 28.</title>
<headline>FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR JULY 28.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar was fixed at 1.8461</p>
<p>marks in Frankfurt on Monday from 1.8379 marks on Friday.</p>
<p>Other main currencies are fixed against the mark at the</p>
<p>following rates (previous in brackets):</p>
<p>    USD   1.8461 (1.8379)</p>
<p>    GBP   3.0465 (3.0620)</p>
<p>    CHF 121.4200 (121.1500)</p>
<p>    JPY   1.5753 (1.5795)</p>
<p>    ATS  14.2140 (14.2130)</p>
<p>The exchange rates are used in Bulgaria for accounting,</p>
<p>statistical and customs purposes and are valid for Tuesday,</p>
<p>July 29.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 911 88</p>
</text>
